. Setup secure credentials}}\par\pard\li0\fi-360\fs22\'95\tab {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK \l \"2-map-data-fields-straight-from-the-submitted-irequest-form\"}{\fldrslt 2. Map data fields straight from the submitted iRequest form}}\par\pard\li0\fi-360\fs22\'95\tab {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK \l \"3-target-url-targeting-the-pipeline-trigger-endpoint\"}{\fldrslt 3. Target URL targeting the pipeline trigger endpoint}}\par\pard\li0\fi-360\fs22\'95\tab {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK \l \"4-fire-the-command\"}{\fldrslt 4. Fire the command}}\par\pard\li360\fi-360\fs22\'95\tab {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK \l \"step-3-raw-curl-format-if-irequest-cannot-use-powershell\"}{\fldrslt Step 3: Raw Curl Format (If iRequest cannot use PowerShell)}}\par\pard\li360\fi-360\fs22\'95\tab {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK \l \"critical-security-notice-for-scom-scripts\"}{\fldrslt  Critical Security Notice for SCOM Scripts}}\par\pard\sa120\par
